timeline.body:
This adds a `LOCATE` function to ES|QL.

```
PUT testidx
{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "text_field": {
        "type": "keyword"
      }
    }
  }
}

POST testidx/_doc
{ "text_field": "hello" }

POST _query
{
  "query": """
  FROM testidx|
  EVAL s = locate(text_field, 'll')
  """
}

```
closes #106818

